WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.880 --> 00:00:05.760
If you blink, you die. That’s the first&nbsp;
thing you need to know about SCP-173,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:05.760 --> 00:00:09.120
a monstrous living sculpture&nbsp;
contained by the SCP Foundation,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:09.120 --> 00:00:12.960
a Secret organization dedicated to&nbsp;
protecting humanity from the anomalous.

00:00:12.960 --> 00:00:17.120
Also known as The Sculpture, The Killer&nbsp;
Statue, and even sometimes… The Peanut,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:17.120 --> 00:00:21.040
this unassuming piece of modern art remains&nbsp;
completely still while you’re looking at it.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:21.040 --> 00:00:24.000
However, if you look away, even&nbsp;
for a fraction of a second,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:28.160
the statue will dart towards you at lightning&nbsp;
speeds. What happens if it reaches you?

00:00:28.160 --> 00:00:31.920
Simply put, the sculpture will snap your&nbsp;
neck with a nasty crunch - its favorite&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:31.920 --> 00:00:36.080
way to dispatch a victim. There’s no&nbsp;
way to fight back against SCP-173.&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:36.080 --> 00:00:40.320
All you can do is keep looking and hope you&nbsp;
don’t blink, that’s the only way to survive.

00:00:40.320 --> 00:00:43.760
Of course the average human blinks&nbsp;
about twelve times per minute. So now&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:43.760 --> 00:00:47.760
ask yourself, how many times have&nbsp;
you blinked while watching this?

